# D-105 native (steps/d105-native.md §4; the author's Q39: "сначала в интерпретаторе и потом нативно"): a native method
# passes `o: Other` (Model's fields in the other order) to `rd (Model: m)`.  The call site records o in
# the arena's implements table with the unit's pair table Other -> Model, and rd reads m\a at the slot
# the record gives: 10.  Before: 20 -- Model's slot 0, Other's b -- silently.  Success is 7; 5 is 20.
Model:
    size_t: a 1U
    size_t: b 2U
end: Model
Other:
    size_t: b 20U
    size_t: a 10U
end: Other
fn: rd (Model: m) size_t
return: m\a
fn: go () size_t
    o: merge Other
    return: rd(o)
size_t: got 0U
got: go()
int: ok 3
if: got = 10U
    ok: 7
if: got = 20U
    ok: 5
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: ok; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
